      Ran into fatal error: zmq.hpp: No such file or directory
        means that the C++ ZeroMQ header file (zmq.hpp) is not found in the sysroot or include path during cross-compilation.
        
        Get the C++ header (zmq.hpp)
          download just the header:
            wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zeromq/cppzmq/master/zmq.hpp -P include/
          Install zmq.hpp to SDK sysroot
            sudo cp zmq.hpp /tools/Xilinx/Petalinux/2024.2/sdk/sysroots/cortexa72-cortexa53-xilinx-linux/usr/include/
  
    
